      "title": "\u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 CodeFormer \u2014 Face Restoration",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 CodeFormer \u2014 Face Restoration\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 FaceRestoreModelLoader\n**Model:** `codeformer.pth`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/facerestore_models/`\n> Best face restoration \u2014 works great on talking avatar outputs\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde9 Required Custom Nodes\n- facerestore_cf\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n- Fidelity weight 0.5 = balanced restore vs original. Lower = more aggressive fix\n- Run this after InfiniteTalk/MultiTalk to clean up face artifacts\n- GFPGANv1.4.pth also pre-installed for faster, lighter restoration\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcda ApexForge by Alex Harte\n\ud83c\udf10 **Guides & updates:** https://alexanderharte.com\n\ud83d\ude80 **All models are pre-installed on your pod.**\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Just load this workflow and start generating.**"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# \u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 CodeFormer \u2014 Face Restoration\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 FaceRestoreModelLoader\n**Model:** `codeformer.pth`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/facerestore_models/`\n> Best face restoration \u2014 works great on talking avatar outputs\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde9 Required Custom Nodes\n- facerestore_cf\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n- Fidelity weight 0.5 = balanced restore vs original. Lower = more aggressive fix\n- Run this after InfiniteTalk/MultiTalk to clean up face artifacts\n- GFPGANv1.4.pth also pre-installed for faster, lighter restoration\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcda ApexForge by Alex Harte\n\ud83c\udf10 **Guides & updates:** https://alexanderharte.com\n\ud83d\ude80 **All models are pre-installed on your pod.**\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Just load this workflow and start generating.**"
